<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.5">
<l>tōṭṭa millava ḷāttoḻu vōṭai</l>
<l rend="indent">tuṭavai yuṅkiṇa ṟumivai yellām</l>
<l>vāṭṭa miṉṟiyuṉ poṉṉaṭik kīḻē</l>
<l rend="indent">vaḷaippa kamvakut tukkoṇṭi runtēṉ</l>
<l>nāṭṭu māṉiṭat tōṭeṉak karitu</l>
<l rend="indent">naccu vārpalar kēḻaloṉ ṟāki</l>
<l>kōṭṭu maṇkoṇṭa koḷkaiyi ṉāṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">kuñca ramvīḻak kompocit tāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>[My] garden, wife, cow, stable, resevoir, fields, and wells,</l>
<l rend="indent">all of these, without fail, I have taken</l>
<l rend="indent">and apportioned them in a heap at your golden feet.</l>
<l>For me it is diffucult to [associate] with earthly men</l>
<l rend="indent">who have many desires.</l>
<l>You who vowed, having become a boar,</l>
<l rend="indent">to take the earth upon [your] tusks!</l>
<l>You who broke the elephant’s tusk so that [it] perished!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
